DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270111
DTSTAMP:20261120T185733Z
UID:ceb34ccac023e3e8e7604fe366c7@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holiday season at the Greenwich Historical Socie
 ty! Visit our newly arranged period rooms and explore the holidays celebra
 ted in the 18th century. Guests will tour the first floor of Bush-Holley H
 ouse\, festively decorated for the 1780s. See how the Dutch English Bush f
 amily welcomed family and friends for a traditional New England Thanksgivi
 ng\; celebrated the arrival of St. Nicholas\, the precursor of Santa Claus
 \, with gifts and treats for the children\; and marked the last night of t
 he Christmas holiday season with a feast on Twelfth Night.\n\nSource: http
